  "description": "Plain EF Core LINQ that runs under Native AOT. A source generator translates each query to parameterized SQL at build time and intercepts the call; at runtime it runs on the DbContext's own connection and transaction with generated readers, without runtime query translation or compilation. Supports filtering, ordering, paging, terminals, query filters, tracking and Include/ThenInclude, with EF Core's semantics. Anything it cannot translate is a build error. Ships the runtime, the generator and the MSBuild settings that enable its interceptors.",
